            "review_title": "Review at Caztus Ice Blended",
            "review_text": "Henry V\nMelbourne, Australia6 contributions\n0\nVery Bad Parking Policy and Unhygienic Toilet Condition\nApr 2019 • Friends\nDodgy parking policy, staff does not inform about free parking which you will have to get your ticket stamp. Parking staff is very rude, refuse to give your money back even though i asked to wait while i return to the shop to get my ticket stamped. The shop does not stamp your ticket by default so if you forgot to get it, bad luck. It look like staffs dont even aware of this policy. Toilet is dirty and full of chemical smells, not cleaned regularly\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 29, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
