            "review_title": "Review at Caztus Ice Blended",
            "review_text": "Tinanim\nLos Angeles, California2 contributions\n0\nReally good, creative drinks and snacks\nJun 2015 • Friends\nNice little place for young folks to hang at. They have a great variety of ice blended drinks and many little snacks. I would love to try every single of the drink but my tiny tummy does not allow that unfortunately. I tried the chocolate one and it was delish! I also loved the mini brownies. Highly recommend if you would like to spend your time at a hip little place with some little sweet treats. Definitely will come back~\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 2, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
